{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you successfully reflect a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," back at its originator, the originator may attempt to ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rebuke"]}," the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," as well, expending a use of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rebuke"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," and using your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check as its target DC. If they reflect it back again, both you and the originator are affected by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},". You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to suffer no effects from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," that has been ",{"tag":"i","children":["Rebuked"]}," twice- once by you and once by the Force Power's originator.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
